    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get all that but when you talk about 'compliance' and 'rules' it sounds like you're saying they're just extra costs. if we actually stripped back the regulatory burden and let the market work more freely, do you think that would solve the innovation problem, or is there some kind of fundamental reason why we need all this oversight?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
